  {
   "id": "strike-force-heroes-277203@major-2024-05-19",
   "gameId": "strike-force-heroes-277203",
   "displayName": "Serious Bugfixes & Balance update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-19T01:39:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey heroes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After it's been a hot minute (1 month!) but we've noticed a number of serious bugs in the game that were introduced in the Ninja DLC. So we're put together a mega update with not only a ton of serious bug fixes, but also a number of huge balance changes to bonus objectives, missions and overall gameplay!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update should make the overall experience feel much smoother, and less unfairly difficult at times.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "v1.26",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Additions",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added 5 new Legendary outfits based on Community member AniArtistMe for his incredible bug spotting!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hero Select & Shop no longer behave strangely on first load",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prototype mission rewards no longer softlock the game in rare situations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tear Gas now properly works on the Missile & Speeding Train maps",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kevlar Vests now properly works in FFA/Solo type games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wrath of the Tiger properly gives -25% damage taken instead of -75%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disabling Passives/Abilities/Gadgets in custom mode now works as expected",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Setting specific weapons allowed in custom mode now works as expected",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a rare bug where switching classes in a FFA mode will put you on blue team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unique characters (Riggs, Bull, Toad, etc) now have their proper class & loadout again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Winning/Losing a match will always display the correct winning score",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bayonet's execute now works as expected",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "BoStaff no longer has a damage delay when attacking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted AI jumps on Hijack, Missile, Crash, and Foundry",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The volume of rocket trails are now adjusted by Sound Volume",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few spelling/text issues in game and menus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balance",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "(Gameplay)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted many Bonus objectives in missions to make them more easily obtainable",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "At the results screen, deaths are now only -3 points instead of -5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Challenge mission \"Self Experiments\" & Alt versions has 1 less enemy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ninja will show up as a random enemy/ally 25% less often to avoid Melee spam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lowered enemy Hp by 10% on gungame (since you can't use your own gear)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Juggernaut, the Juggernaut can no longer gain extra armor (same as heals)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kevlar Vest ability now gives +30% more armor",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kevlar Vest armor is capped for enemies above lvl 30",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pheonix blade removed from all enemies in SideOps 8, 8-1, 8-2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Challenge 6-2: Health reduced, Enemies reduced by 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Challenge 8-1: +40% Health",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Challenge 10 & Alt versions: you have faster drone charge rate while enemies are slower.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Challenge 10-1: Enemies deal -20% damage",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your own weapons sounds are only 10% quieter instead of 20% quieter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Melee Enemies attack slightly slower",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Melee Enemies now do much less damage (even less at lower levels): (Menus)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gadgets appear in the shop ~15% less frequently: (Ninja Weapons)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kunai: FireRate -20%, Impact -10%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Healing Salve: Ammo -4, FireRate -10%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Baseball: ProjectileSpeed +15%, Range +10%, Accuracy +10%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spikeball: Range +10%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rock: FireRate +15%, ProjectileSpeed +10%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bostaff: DashDistance -66%, FireRate -10%, Impact +10%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nunchucks: Dash Removed, FireRate +5%, Impact -20%, Range -5%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chakram: Range/Duration +15%: (Other Weapons)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "M202: SpareClips +2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "ALL Melee weapon Impact +10%: As always, thanks for sticking around as we continue to fix & improve the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
