  {
   "id": "strike-force-heroes-277203@major-2023-12-09",
   "gameId": "strike-force-heroes-277203",
   "displayName": "Strike Force Heroes Christmas Update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-09T01:22:19.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "CHRISTMAS UPDATE!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's the most wonderful time of the year!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To help everyone get in the spirit, we're updating the game with free Christmas themed skins and a new map! Each Hero receives a brand new Legendary skin (with female variants) that can be found in the shop and slot machine.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new map, Training Grounds, is available in Custom Game and Daily Missions, complete with holiday appropriate music! While the skins are permanent, the Christmas themed map is only here for a limited time, after which the Heroes will take down the decorations (the map will stay, just without the Christmas theme).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Look forward to further content updates and patches in the coming months and be sure to join our Discord, where our members were able to vote on which skins made it into the game! We hope you all enjoy this update and have a safe and Happy Holiday season!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "<3 Justin & Mike",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "v1.16 Patch Notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Daily Missions now exclusively feature the new festive Training map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New festive Training map is can now be picked in Custom mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4 new festive outfits permanently added to the Shop & Slot machine!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
